WEBVTT

00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:04.578
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> Is the car for you, sir?

00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:06.652
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> No, it’s for me.

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:09.271
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Yes, it’s for my mother.

00:00:09.678 --> 00:00:13.384
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> Well madam, what about this blue car here?

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:16.365
It’s small and it’s easy to park.

00:00:16.873 --> 00:00:19.707
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Yes, Mum, it’s perfect for you.

00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:22.109
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> But it’s very slow.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:23.657
And it’s ugly.

00:00:24.282 --> 00:00:28.422
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> It’s an electric car, madam. Very eco-friendly.

00:00:28.729 --> 00:00:30.123
They’re good cars.

00:00:30.408 --> 00:00:33.658
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> I prefer…that red car.

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:37.204
<v><b>Man:</b></v> But Mum, it’s a sports car!

00:00:37.823 --> 00:00:39.383
It’s very fast.

00:00:39.631 --> 00:00:41.783
And it’s very expensive.

00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:44.598
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Yes, but it’s my money.

00:00:45.328 --> 00:00:48.371
It’s a beautiful car and I love it!

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.122
How much is it?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.190
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> Come with me, madam.

00:00:52.805 --> 00:00:53.699
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Mum! …